                    350.0,
                    706.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "Sickness disability benefits, where payable, shall be granted upon the net credited service at the time the leave was granted plus the elapsed time on Military Leave of Absence to the termination of such leave, and shall be computed on the basis of Lucent pay in effect at the time of the employee's reinstatement.",
